k-0"><span class="break-words"><!----> taufiq.nsu16@gmail.com <!----></span></p><!----></td><td style="vertical-align: top; width: 30%; text-align: right;"><img alt="Profile Image" class="profile-photo ng-star-inserted" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><!----><!----><!----></td></tr></table><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"></div><div style="margin-bottom: 0.125rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding-left: 3px; ;padding-bottom: 10px; background-color: #E6E6E6;"> Career Objective: </h3><p style="font-size: 12px; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 7px; padding-bottom: 10px; word-break: break-word;">To secure a role in a well-established organization where I can apply my marketing knowledge, MS Office expertise, graphic design skills, and strong interpersonal abilities to create measurable impact.</p></div><!----><div style="margin-bottom: 0.125rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding-left: 3px; padding-bottom: 10px; background-color: #E6E6E6;"> Career Summary: </h3><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 7px; padding-bottom: 10px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><div class="career-Summary"><p>Results-driven marketing professional skilled in campaign execution, brand growth, and data-driven performance marketing. Experienced in digital strategy, content, and analytics to improve acquisition, engagement, and ROI.</p></div></div></div><!----><div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding-left: 3px; padding-bottom: 10px; background-color: #E6E6E6;">Special Qualification:</h3><p style="font-size: 12px; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 7px; padding-bottom: 10px; word-break: break-word;">Business graduate majoring in Marketing with strong consumer behavior knowledge and skills in content creation and graphic design. Proactive, detail-oriented, and collaborative with strong communication and presentation abilities.</p></div><!----><div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding-left: 3px; ;padding-bottom: 10px; background-color: #E6E6E6;"> Employment History: </h3><p style="font-size: 12px; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 7px; padding-bottom: 10px; word-break: break-word;" class="ng-star-inserted"><strong>Total Year of Experience:</strong> 0.3 yrs </p><!----><div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 12px;" class="ng-star-inserted"><div style="display: flex;"><div style="width: 1.5rem;">1.</div><div style="flex: 1;"><div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;" class="ng-star-inserted"> Intern Officer  (0.2 yrs) <!----></div><!----><div style="font-size: 12px;" class="ng-star-inserted"> (30 January, 2023 - <!----> 30 April, 2023 <!----> ) </div><!----><div style="margin-top: 0.25rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><strong>South Bangla Agriculture and Commerce Bank Limited</strong></div><div class="ng-star-inserted">Pragati Sarani </div><!----><!----><div style="margin-top: 0.25rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><strong>Area of Expertise</strong><div>General Banking (3 months), Marketing (3 months)</div></div><!----><div style="margin-top: 0.25rem;" class="ng-star-inserted"><strong>Duties/Responsibilities</strong><div><p>1.Assisted in daily banking operations including customer service.Mainly worked in General Banking Department.Collaborated with team members on various projects aimed at improving customer experienceand operational efficiency.</p></div></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted"><h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding-left: 3px; padding-bottom: 10px; background-color: #E6E6E6;">Academic Qualification:</h3><div class="pt-[10px] overflow-x-auto thin-scrollbar"><table class="border border-gray-300 min-w-full education-table" style="width: 500